    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1966-p10.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "If the numbers are \\(u,\\) and \\(v,\\) then \\[ \\begin{aligned} u^3+v^3 &=(u+v)^3-3uv(u+v)\\\\ &=1^3-3=-2. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
